<title>FRANCE: Machinery top Paris air export to Asia/MEast in '96.</title>
<headline>Machinery top Paris air export to Asia/MEast in '96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Machinery, motors, equipment and parts was the leading category of goods exported to the Middle East and Asia from the Paris airports, Charles de Gaulle and Orly in 1996, French Ministry of Transport (MoT) figures showed.</p>
<p>The top ten categories of goods exported from the Paris airports in 1996 in tonnes with percentage change from 1995 were::</p>
<p>	Category		    1996     Pct change</p>
<p>   1. Machinery, motors	 18,731    up    7.7</p>
<p>	 equipment &amp; parts</p>
<p>   2. Perfumes		    10,980    up    5.7</p>
<p>   3. Travel goods/garments/   9,966    up    2.7</p>
<p>	 hosiery/footwear</p>
<p>   4. Assorted manufactured    3,829    down  7.7</p>
<p>goods</p>
<p>   5. Textiles/fabrics	   2,939    down 11.4</p>
<p>   6. Medicines/		   2,308    up    6.4</p>
<p>	 pharmaceuticals</p>
<p>   7. Vehicles/transport	 2,002    up    4.9</p>
<p>	 equipment/parts</p>
<p>   8. Dairy products	     1,903	   n.a.</p>
<p>   9. Printed matter	     1,541	   n.a.</p>
<p> 10. Raw plastics		    619    down 19.1</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
